## Architecture Overview

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                         FLOW OVERVIEW                               │
│                                                                     │
│  [Warehouse Admin]                                                  │
│    • Generate QR Code (contains warehouseId + signed token)         │
│    • Set GPS coordinates + check-in radius                          │
│                                                                     │
│  [Delivery Partner App]                                             │
│    • Scan QR → POST /api/warehouse/checkin                          │
│    • Backend verifies: GPS distance ≤ warehouse checkinRadius       │
│    • On success → rider added to WarehouseQueue (sorted by time)    │
│                                                                     │
│  [Background GPS Watchdog] (every 60s via BullMQ)                  │
│    • For each checked-in rider, verify current GPS vs warehouse     │
│    • If outside radius → auto-evict from queue                      │
│                                                                     │
│  [Order Assignment Engine]                                          │
│    • When seller accepts → find warehouse for this order            │
│    • Pick eligible rider from top of warehouse queue (FIFO)         │
│    • Emit order offer with 20s timer                                │
│    • If rejected/timeout → next rider in queue                      │
│                                                                     │
│  [Queue Dashboard] (WebSocket + REST)                               │
│    • Admin and Warehouse see live queue, GPS status, order state    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

