#### [NEW] `warehouseQueueAssignmentService.js`
**Path**: `backend/app/services/warehouseQueueAssignmentService.js`

Separates queue-assignment logic from the main workflow service:
```
offerToNextInQueue(orderId, warehouseId, attemptedRiderIds = [])
  → Get queue, skip already-attempted riders
  → Validate all conditions (GPS, online, no active delivery, vehicle)
  → Schedule 20s BullMQ job
  → Emit socket offer to single rider

handleRiderResponse(riderId, orderId, accepted)
  → If accepted: deliveryAcceptAtomic() (existing)
  → If rejected: offerToNextInQueue(orderId, warehouseId, [...attemptedRiderIds, riderId])
  → If no more riders: fall back to broadcast mode
```

