## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `backend/__tests__/warehouseCheckin.test.js` — unit tests for GPS verification, QR token signing/validation, queue FIFO ordering
- `backend/__tests__/queueAssignment.test.js` — tests for eligibility filtering, 20s timeout, fallback to broadcast

### Manual Verification
1. Warehouse admin generates QR code → renders on screen
2. Set warehouse GPS + 100m radius
3. Rider scans QR with GPS inside radius → check-in succeeds, queue position shown
4. Rider scans QR with GPS outside radius → rejected with clear error
5. Seller accepts order → offer appears on correct rider's screen with 20s countdown
6. Rider rejects → offer moves to next rider
7. Rider walks away (GPS update outside radius) → auto-evicted from queue within 60s
8. Rider goes offline → evicted from queue
9. Admin dashboard shows live queue updates
10. Warehouse dashboard shows live queue updates

